                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class we learned how to measure in the vertical direction and in the horizontal direction with a ruler, and how this helps us see whether two objects share the same width and the same height.\n\nThis is progress, but it is still only part of the comparison: two objects can match in width and height and still differ in another direction, such as color or shape.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
